senses.gloss:
अग्नीय a. [अग्नेः अदूरभवं स्थानादि;
उत्करा˚छ] Situated near the fire;
relating to fire, fiery.

अग्नीषोमीय a. [अग्नीषोमौ देवते यस्य
छ] Relating or sacred to Agni and
Soma; ˚निर्वापः making libations with
the cake sacred to Agni and Soma;
˚पशुः a victim sacred to them;
˚पुरोडाशः an oblation sacred to them &c.
